  "body": "Starts Following from authorized clubs before joining visible posts and applying the page limit. Adds supporting club/post/officer indexes and marks read functions STABLE so internal reads use the calling statement's authorization snapshot. Blocked recipients cannot poll relationship revision metadata; the blocker retains its own unblock control.\n\nDepends on #365. Draft, unmerged and inactive. Existing membership remains required; a follow never grants club access.\n\nVerification: PostgreSQL fixtures passed publication ties, edits, backdated insertion, deletion, membership revocation, block exclusions and snapshot classification. On the committed synthetic 50k-post sparse fixture, the earlier feed exceeded 30 seconds. Final warm p95 was 102.321ms sparse / 185.770ms empty, under the predeclared 200ms read threshold. Cold empty EXPLAIN was 241.535ms; no cold or production SLO is claimed. Discover and feed workload/environment details are in docs/social/performance.md.\n\nApply the additive read-model SQL only in reviewed non-production fixtures. The runtime gate remains off. Index builds are transactional and require production lock-duration qualification. Pause preserves publication positions and all consent/block writes; never renumber positions or fall back to block-ignoring endpoints after activation. Full-schema rehearsal, managed identity and legacy/worker/media policy integration remain incomplete.\n",
